<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine oils and grain prices up with Chicago.</title>
<headline>Argentine oils and grain prices up with Chicago.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the Buenos Aires Cereals Exchange were boosted Thursday by the firmness of oils in Chicago, dealers said.</p>
<p>Cash soybean prices rose in line with gains in Chicago, as well as on help from excessive rainfall in Brazil. Sunseed was helped higher by the low yields of the harvest so far.</p>
<p>Cash wheat prices rose on the lack of sellers while maize was quietly firmer on export demand.</p>
<p>(( -- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
